[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17713.59, "timestamp": "04:55:13", "text": "嗯哼。是零。序號是奇數。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17719.11, "timestamp": "04:55:19", "text": "不是零。好的。否則，如果只有一條線，如果沒有紅線，否則剪斷第四根線。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17722.15, "timestamp": "04:55:22", "text": "好的。一、二、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17731.67, "timestamp": "04:55:31", "text": "三、四。嗨，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17733.91, "timestamp": "04:55:33", "text": "漫射。下一根線又是六根"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17751.99, "timestamp": "04:55:51", "text": "。紅、白、黃、黃、藍、白、黃、黃、藍、白、白、紅、白、黃、黃、"}]